  m_text: "- Fully filled progression bar during Base Game triggers Outback Beauty
    Free Games.\n- During <style=coinColor>Outback Beauty Free Games</style>, game
    starts with Progression Bar already fully filled with \n  12 Collectibles.\n-
    Every spin, one          is deducted but player can collect          from the
    reels and game continues\n  until the progression bar is empty. \n- Slot-in-Slot
    Feature is available as in Base Game.\n- Golden Sub-Symbols appear as in Lucky
    Coin Free Games."
